ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 37% of normal in March to April and 137% in August to September. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 14% of normal. On grid 24125 the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 152.7, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
